{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"pangfa-e-o002b","title":"庞统解释褒扬人物之意","accounts":[{"id":"pangfa-e-o002b-account","label":"《庞统法正传第七》正文","text":"庞统解释自己褒扬人物以劝人为善的用意。","evidence":["pangfa-e-o002b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0048","role":"答问","evidence":["pangfa-e-o002b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文未明示时间","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["pangfa-e-o002b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"pangfa-e-o002b-q","source_order":[37,3,"O002b"],"order":6952}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0048","name":"庞统","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"pangfa-e-o002b-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-993b590c22113950c301","layer":"original","quote":"性好人伦〖6〗，勤于长养〖7〗；每所称述，多过其才。时人怪而问之，统答曰：“当今天下大乱，雅道陵迟〖8〗；善人少而恶人多。方欲兴风俗，长道业，不美其谈，即声名不足慕企；不足慕企，而为善者少矣。今拔十失五〖9〗，犹得其半；而可以崇迈世教〖10〗，使有志者自励。不亦可乎？”","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":145,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
